  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The plates of this armor are gray and cold, and frost forms on them in a warm room. Whoever wears it casts a shadow a little too long, as if the sun stood lower for them alone.</p><p>You have a +3 bonus to Armor Class while you wear this armor.</p><p>While you wear this armor, you have Resistance to Necrotic damage, and your Hit Point maximum cannot be reduced.</p><p><strong>Refuse the Grave.</strong> Once per day, when you would drop to 0 Hit Points, you drop to 1 Hit Point instead. The armor regains this power at dawn.</p><p><strong>The Dead Remember It.</strong> The dead recognize this armor. Mindless undead will not attack its wearer first, and any spirit the wearer questions answers once, truthfully, before it remembers that it has no reason to.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
